Subject: [PATCH] Allow existing UN1CA identity-field overrides on One UI 9

ART rejects reflective writes to static final fields on the One UI 9 cohort.
Keep the existing per-process UN1CA Build hooks working by making only their
eleven already-used identity fields mutable. Keep SDK_INT, SDK_INT_FULL,
release values, serial access and the runtime's general final-field rules.
No reflection/JNI bypass, attestation implementation or SELinux rule is added.

